extends layout.pug

block content

  article.portfolio-intro

    h1 A Software Development Portfolio

    p This portfolio is a dynamic web application built with Node.js, Express, and Pug to showcase my software development projects. It highlights my technical skills, problem-solving abilities, and experience building applications using different programming languages and technologies. Visitors can explore individual projects, view screenshots, learn about the technologies used, and access the corresponding GitHub repositories.


  article.portfolio-project-thumbs
  .projects-box.box.grid
    each project in projects
      .cell
        a(href=`/projects/${project.id}`)
          img.thumbnail(src=project.image_urls[0] || 'https://placehold.co/550x550', alt=`Thumbnail of ${project.project_name}`)
          h5= project.project_name

